# Escondite Vertice, B1F (villain hideout B1F, C4b, contract 41), 14 x 16, interior. column = i, row = j. Steel plates (metal_<i%2><j%2>), cable walls, crates and consoles; the floor is a field of nine 3 x 3 PLATFORMS
# joined by ARROW BELTS (the approved arr_* pieces: the hero is pushed along a belt until a plain tile, contract 35.3; a belt is one way): ONE route leads from the stairs up (from the casino, door (2,2)) to the stairs down
# (door (12,2)); the other belts carry you round the field (the digraph is strongly connected: nobody is stuck). The elevator panel (Hoist Key, `llave_polea`) is in the middle platform; two grunts; items in the corners.
@map escondite_1
@size 14 16
@interior yes
@area escondite_vertice
@bg 3
@fill metal_00
@spawn up 2 3 S
@spawn down 12 3 S
@spawn lift 7 10 NE
@legend
  .  tile=metal_00
  a  tile=none object=cable_wall_j
  b  tile=none object=cable_wall_i
  c  tile=metal_11 object=crate_plain
  d  tile=metal_01 object=escalator
